# Line endings are not cosmetic in this project.
#
# pi/install.sh, pi/hotspot.sh and the systemd units in pi/systemd/ are run on
# the Raspberry Pi. A carriage return at the end of a shebang or a unit
# directive is a syntax error there, and tests/test_pi_files.py checks for one.
# Git on Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, so without this file anyone who
# clones the repository on Windows gets CRLF in those scripts and a broken
# installer. Normalising in .gitattributes fixes it for every clone, instead of
# asking each person to change their Git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
